# detail
Number of changes: 2

1. Added | Conditional statement
   Added an `if not self._has_gouraud` conditional statement that sets `self._has_gouraud` and writes two `filter` elements when the condition is satisfied.
   This includes:

   * Assignment statement: assign `True` to `self._has_gouraud`;
   * Method calls: call `writer.start`, `writer.element`, and `writer.end` to write elements related to `colorAdd` and `colorMat`.

2. Modified | Loop statement
   Changed the iteration variables from `tri, col` to `points, colors`, and changed the arguments of `_draw_gouraud_triangle` in the loop body from `gc, tri, col, transform` to `trans_and_flip.transform(points), colors`.
# /detail
